      x: '<p><b class="rd">the</b> <b>yagona</b> narsalar oldidan: <b>the sun, the moon, the Earth, the world, the sky, the equator</b>. <b class="rd">the</b> <b>superlative</b> oldidan: <b>the highest</b> mountain, <b>the largest</b> desert. <b class="rd">the</b> <b>tartib son</b> oldidan: <b>the first</b>, <b>the second</b>.</p><p>Birinchi marta tilga olinsa <b>a / an</b>, ikkinchi marta <b>the</b>: «I saw <b>a</b> lake. <b>The</b> lake was huge.»</p><p>Ba’zi iboralar: <b>the north / south / east / west</b>, <b>the countryside</b>, <b>the sea</b> (umumiy).</p>',
